{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣天后張惠妹（阿妹）下月13日將迎來出道30周年紀念日，她的新歌《不情之請》將於今個月27日推出，近日更拋出震撼彈，有消息指張惠妹將於明年2月重返台北大巨蛋，更持續透過不同方式跟歌迷見面。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;張惠妹</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T07:22:38.804475+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T06:10:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T07:15:57.074908+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T07:15:57.074908+00:00","content_hash":"98a1b27d1bdbb8854b777a83bd394c07183e3c16064bd9a910f94c1c64aec59e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}